# An allowlist for a hand-run `docker build` from the repo root, which must fail.
# The real build (scripts/container/image_build.py) stages its own context and
# never reads this file; .gitattributes keeps it out of `git archive`.
# Never re-include data/, huginn-*/, scripts/ (graph JSON lives there, gitignored)
# or an archive.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements/
